        <a class="card__wcag" href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/info-and-relationships.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WCAG SC 1.3.1<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a>
