        <span class="action-items__text">Fix 2 instances of <em>Ensures &lt;img&gt; elements have alternate text or a role of none or presentation</em></span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li class="action-items__item">
      <a href="#finding-2-label" class="action-items__link">
        <span class="action-items__badge action-items__badge--critical" aria-label="Severity: Critical">Critical</span>
